      "@type": "AnalogicalMapping",
      "instance_name": "mapping_1",
      "label": "The man is mapped as the speaker of the text",
      "description": "The text 'i like my coffee like i like my slaves' and 'extra dark' is overlaid on the image of the man, creating an analogical mapping where the man is implicitly identified as the speaker of the text. His stern, authoritative posture and expression reinforce the hateful tone of the statement, suggesting he is the one who holds this preference. The visual material (the man) is mapped onto the textual material (the statement) to imply that he is the source or embodiment of the hateful analogy.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
